Practice Joins Only
1. Retrieve all records by joining both tables:
SELECT pricing_data.*, company_details.Company_Name, company_details.Sector, company_details.Country
FROM pricing_data
JOIN company_details ON pricing_data.Seq_id = company_details.Seq_id;

2. Find all companies in the IT sector with their pricing details:
SELECT pricing_data.M_Price , company_details.Company_Name , company_details.Sector
FROM company_details
JOIN pricing_data ON pricing_data.Seq_id = company_details.Seq_id
WHERE company_details.Sector = 'IT';
